# @plugin(@varlock/aws-secrets-plugin)
# @initAws(region=us-east-2)
# ---
# CloudWatch Omni space admin. IAM role ARN or AWSReservedSSO role name.
# Loaded from the `envs` secret in us-east-2. See https://varlock.dev/plugins/aws-secrets/
# @required
CLOUDWATCH_OMNI_ADMIN_ROLE=awsSecret("envs#CLOUDWATCH_OMNI_ADMIN_ROLE")
